<title>MOROCCO: Morocco to celebrate Eid al-Adha holiday April 18.</title>
<headline>Morocco to celebrate Eid al-Adha holiday April 18.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will celebrate the feast of Eid al-Adha on April 18, a public holiday.</p>
<p>The Religious Affairs Ministry announced the date after the sighting of the new moon.</p>
